Package: tidybiome
Type: Package
Title: Tidyverse-Native Modern Microbiome Analysis Suite
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Tidybiome", "Authors", email = "info@tidybiome.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Tidybiome Authors
Maintainer: Tidybiome Authors <info@tidybiome.org>
Description: A modern, tidyverse-native Swiss Army knife for downstream microbiome
    analysis. Implements state-of-the-art bioRxiv and literature methodologies for
    compositional transformation (Robust CLR), alpha diversity (unified Hill numbers
    profile), beta diversity (Robust Aitchison distance), ordination (RPCA biplots),
    multi-engine consensus differential abundance testing, and data-driven core microbiome
    discovery, paired with publication-grade aesthetic visualizations.
